{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"automated blender image rendering automated blender image rendering","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","fileName":"Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Automated Blender Image Rendering","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 09:04\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Automated Blender Texturing and Rendering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Automated Blender Texturing and Rendering","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"automated blender image rendering automated blender image rendering","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","fileName":"Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Automated Blender Image Rendering","heading":"Automated Blender Image Rendering","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An automated Blender still-render pipeline prepares materials, lights, a scene camera, image dimensions, and an output path before invoking a render operation that writes the image. The camera must be assigned to the scene, since the full renderer uses that camera to determine the frame.\n\nThe source contrasts a full Blender render with an OpenGL snapshot of the 3D Viewport. The full render includes the scene's lighting and material result at higher computational cost; the viewport render captures a faster working view and can use the user's current viewing context. Both become reliable only after the script controls their required scene state.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Automated Blender Texturing and Rendering","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"automated blender image rendering automated blender image rendering","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","fileName":"Automated Blender Image Rendering.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Automated Blender Image Rendering","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[blenderpythonapi.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Automated Blender Texturing and Rendering","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}